{
  "version": "1.0",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-01",
  "decisionRef": "P3",
  "notes": [
    "Single source of truth for PRIV-06 retention. Every store in docs/privacy/data-inventory.md section 2 has exactly one row.",
    "retentionDays is the value enforcement applies today; null means no expiry is applied. status is the approval state of that value: 'decided' is an owner-approved commitment, 'pending' is current/unset configuration awaiting owner decision P3. A pending row never closes PRIV-06.",
    "Do not coerce a pending/null row into an invented period."
  ],
  "stores": [
